{"id":1540,"level":64,"name":"Кінь проти ферзя","group":"Сила фігур","format":31,"description":"<div id='example_left'><p>Your knight wants to capture a flag. <br /> But watch out!<br /> The black queen is guarding the flags.<br /> She wants to take the knight.</p>  <p>A queen is a very strong piece. Much stronger than a knight.<br /> Fortunately, she does not play at her best.<br /> If you stay alert, you can succeed.</p>  <h3><br />What do you have to do?</h3>  <p>Capture a flag with your knight. Don&rsquo;t let the queen take your knight!</p></div><div id='example_right'><p><img src='img/blog/uploads/158480--564c-knight_vs_queen.png' alt='' width='282' height='283' /></p></div>","assignment":"","stickerID":11,"examples":[],"puzzles":[{"id":71764,"fen":"FFFFFFFF/3q4/8/8/8/8/8/4N3 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71765,"fen":"FFFFFFFF/3q4/8/8/8/8/8/2N5 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71766,"fen":"FFFFFFFF/3q4/8/8/8/8/8/6N1 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71767,"fen":"FFFFFFFF/4q3/8/8/8/8/6N1/8 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71768,"fen":"FFFFFFFF/4q3/8/8/8/8/3N4/8 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]}]}